WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:03.537
Everything in this path starts from a 20,000 pesos

00:00:03.537 --> 00:00:06.260
salary in Metro Manila and follows it through a

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:10.408
year Your own numbers replace it wherever Jinnie has

00:00:10.474 --> 00:00:10.697
them

00:00:16.791 --> 00:00:20.370
Your first payslip says 20,000 pesos at the top

00:00:20.409 --> 00:00:25.215
and 18,300 pesos at the bottom The difference did

00:00:25.267 --> 00:00:28.662
not disappear It went to three places

00:00:34.756 --> 00:00:37.309
Net pay is the number your budget starts from

00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:39.009
Not gross
